      "description": "Perched atop a rocky hill at 750 meters above sea level, Stavrovouni Monastery is one of the oldest monasteries in Cyprus and among the earliest in the Christian world. According to tradition, it was founded by Saint Helena in the 4th century, who brought with her a relic of the True Cross. The monastery’s commanding position offers breathtaking panoramic views of the surrounding plains and the sea.",
